// D1244 — a ref local declared in a MODULE-SCOPE block, captured by a closure. This is the
// template the `block_*` positions were added FOR: none of the original twenty opens a block
// whose enclosing scope is the module, so `closure_capture` graded this capability green while
// the row was live. The STRUCT rep is D1244's own witness and its loud cell; the `-list` and
// `-string` siblings carry the two reps the row names as check-clean invalid wasm.
//
// The proof READS A FIELD, because `emitProgram: field access receiver is not a struct` is what
// the read is refused with — a proof that only printed a constant could not see it.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/matrix.py, whose docstring is the spec.
// @@PRELUDE@@
type P = { x: i32 }
// @@VALUE@@
{ x: 7 }
// @@TYPE@@
P
// @@PROOF@@
print(v.x)
// @@WANT@@
7
